	(text "MAX2871 NOTES (DS Rev 4)\n- C8-C11 DC blocks and \"TBD RF\" caps: 0402 C0G chosen near series resonance at 5.8 GHz from vendor S-params.\n- R2-R4 47R series: place at the ESP32 end. R5/R6 100k pulldowns hold CE/RFOUT_EN low at boot.\n- Loop filter C5/R7/C6/R8/C7 = DS 6 GHz values (12n/120/100n/250->249/820p). Re-sim with Kvco @ 5.8 GHz. PDP=1.\n- R11 (50R term) and J2 (U.FL monitor): populate one. J1 TX connector type TBD.\n- Bead-free star: R14-R16 0R 0603 branch links (fallback filter footprints). R17 10R + C28 10uF = TCXO RC, fc ~1.6 kHz.\n- +3V3_SYN from dedicated low-noise LDO (TBD); LC/pi filter at LDO input if fed from a switcher. REF_25M from TCXO (TBD).\n- GND pins 8,9,11,18,21,27,31: own via each, not to EP. EP: >=9-via array."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b3074cb2-821d-4960-8610-d0a224689c6a")
	)
